---

### 3.  Even \(n\) case  

Set \(a_3=2\):

\[
n^{2}-12n+46=2\Longrightarrow n^{2}-12n+44=0 .
\]

The discriminant is \(144-176=-32<0\); no integer solution.  
Hence no even \(n\) works.

